<span class="is-x-eyebrow is-x-rv">Her Story</span>
<h2 class="is-x-title is-x-rv" id="is-x-story-t">From Fortune 100 HR Leader<br/><em>to Somatic Practitioner</em></h2>
<ol class="is-x-chaps" data-is-x-rail="">
<li aria-hidden="true" class="is-x-rail"><span class="is-x-rail-fill"/></li>
<li class="is-x-chap is-x-rv" data-is-x-chap="">
<span aria-hidden="true" class="is-x-chap-node"><i class="fa-solid fa-briefcase"/></span>
<div class="is-x-chap-body">
<span class="is-x-chap-k">Then</span>
<p>Isabelle spent over <strong>30 years</strong> as a Senior HR Business Partner and Talent Management leader in Fortune 100 companies across 9 countries. She built careers, supported leaders, and achieved everything the corporate system rewards. She also went through her own hardship — the quiet damage that toxic work environments and toxic people can cause.</p>
</div>
</li>
<li class="is-x-chap is-x-rv" data-is-x-chap="">
<span aria-hidden="true" class="is-x-chap-node"><i class="fa-solid fa-leaf"/></span>
<div class="is-x-chap-body">
<span class="is-x-chap-k">Now</span>
<p>She healed herself through somatic practices, TRE™, mindfulness and deep personal work. That firsthand journey is what brought her here. She doesn’t approach this work as someone standing above you with a set of techniques. She approaches it as someone who has walked through it, who continues to do her own inner work, and who now walks alongside others as they find their way back: to themselves, their bodies and their aliveness.</p>
</div>
</li>
</ol>
