<h3>Strozzi Somatic Bodywork</h3>
<p>Trained in Strozzi Somatic Bodywork — a body-based methodology that uses gentle, systematic touch to help clients release historical patterns and contractions.</p>
</article>
<article aria-labelledby="is-x-cx-t4" class="is-x-cx-panel" id="is-x-cx-p4" role="tabpanel" tabindex="0">
