<span aria-hidden="true" class="is-x-cx-pico"><i class="fa-solid fa-spa"/></span>
<h3>Certified Accredited Usui/Holy Fire III Reiki Healer</h3>
<p>Certified Accredited Usui/Holy Fire III Reiki healer (lineage of William Lee Rand). Furthering her practice towards Reiki Master and Karuna Reiki — bringing deep energetic healing into her work.</p>
</article>
<article aria-labelledby="is-x-cx-t5" class="is-x-cx-panel" id="is-x-cx-p5" role="tabpanel" tabindex="0">
