<span aria-hidden="true" class="is-x-cx-pico"><i class="fa-solid fa-book-open"/></span>
<h3>Continuously Studying &amp; Growing</h3>
<p>Continuously studying coaching, resilience, somatic and energetic healing modalities. Isabelle is passionate and dedicated to her own development so she can best serve her clients and ensure her practice reflects the latest developments. She is currently studying under recognised teachers specialising in transformational coaching, breathwork, somatic practices, energetic healing, core shamanism and trauma-informed techniques.</p>
</article>
