<h2 class="is-x-quote" data-is-x-words="" id="is-x-note-t">“I don’t do this work from a distance. <em>I’ve walked through it myself.</em> The practices I offer are ones I live — through my own ongoing inner work. Humility is not a value I add on. It is what this path requires.”</h2>
<span aria-hidden="true" class="is-x-note-line is-x-rv"/>
<p class="is-x-note-p is-x-rv">My corporate career gave me every achievement the system rewards — and I also went through my own hardship. The damage a toxic work environment can cause is real. Healing myself through somatic practices is what brought me here. Now I support others to walk through and out of those environments, and to find themselves back: empowered, respected, and as healthy — mentally and physically — as possible.</p>
<p class="is-x-sig is-x-rv">— Isabelle Claus Teixeira</p>
